{"page": 475, "dpi": 400, "psm": 6, "columns": [[{"text": "JSrom πίλω, to press; φίλος, is he", "box": [378, 465, 778, 55], "min_conf": 18.008156}, {"text": "whom we embrace, or kiss. Again,", "box": [391, 518, 764, 52], "min_conf": 95.315544}, {"text": "φιλία is friendship between men,", "box": [396, 571, 759, 54], "min_conf": 95.738586}, {"text": "but love when between the sexes,)", "box": [396, 625, 756, 50], "min_conf": 88.489815}, {"text": "to love, considered in reference to", "box": [394, 680, 765, 50], "min_conf": 96.077286}, {"text": "a natural inclination, or an emotion,", "box": [394, 732, 765, 47], "min_conf": 87.920471}, {"text": "(i.e. the passion of love) (elsewhere", "box": [400, 784, 761, 53], "min_conf": 70.781403}, {"text": "translated to kiss.) (See note, be-", "box": [396, 837, 764, 52], "min_conf": 93.211128}, {"text": "low.)", "box": [398, 890, 103, 52], "min_conf": 96.823555}, {"text": "[Nore.—These two words are not", "box": [347, 995, 816, 54], "min_conf": 70.056992}, {"text": "used indiscriminately. ἀγαπάω,", "box": [401, 1049, 760, 55], "min_conf": 90.042412}, {"text": "never means fo kiss; φιλέω, never", "box": [398, 1102, 767, 53], "min_conf": 92.084648}, {"text": "means fo acquiesce or cherish with", "box": [399, 1156, 764, 53], "min_conf": 90.777863}, {"text": "reverence. φιλέω denotes the sense", "box": [399, 1210, 766, 50], "min_conf": 91.090233}, {"text": "or passion of love, but in ἀγαπάω is", "box": [401, 1262, 762, 54], "min_conf": 63.867775}, {"text": "implied the cause of φιλέω. ἀγαπάω", "box": [402, 1315, 763, 54], "min_conf": 89.893387}, {"text": "is to make much of a thing, to ad-", "box": [402, 1369, 762, 53], "min_conf": 91.868019}, {"text": "mire for some good and sufficient", "box": [402, 1421, 764, 52], "min_conf": 83.567932}, {"text": "reason, but φιλέω denotes the love", "box": [404, 1474, 761, 52], "min_conf": 90.295166}, {"text": "which springs naturally from the", "box": [403, 1527, 763, 55], "min_conf": 96.384071}, {"text": "thing loved, even where no just", "box": [403, 1580, 764, 55], "min_conf": 96.181496}, {"text": "cause of love exists. ἀγαπάω is", "box": [403, 1633, 763, 55], "min_conf": 85.992546}, {"text": "never used of an improper love;", "box": [403, 1687, 763, 54], "min_conf": 95.204018}, {"text": "φιλέω is. Hence, in the NT.", "box": [406, 1740, 759, 53], "min_conf": 3.616653}, {"text": "φιλέω is never used of man's love", "box": [405, 1792, 763, 55], "min_conf": 86.395065}, {"text": "to God, but ἀγαπάω, always.", "box": [406, 1846, 759, 55], "min_conf": 81.409058}, {"text": "Both words are used of God’s love", "box": [408, 1899, 761, 43], "min_conf": 89.884888}, {"text": "to man, ἀγαπάω, when He is said", "box": [406, 1953, 761, 55], "min_conf": 87.82888}, {"text": "to “Love the world,” (John iii.", "box": [404, 2005, 761, 51], "min_conf": 53.347324}, {"text": "16, etc ) and when He wishes men", "box": [408, 2059, 756, 51], "min_conf": 87.759743}, {"text": "good, and seeks their salvation ;", "box": [406, 2107, 764, 61], "min_conf": 92.195572}, {"text": "and φιλέω is affirmed of His love", "box": [406, 2165, 761, 52], "min_conf": 45.158573}, {"text": "to His people who please Him,", "box": [406, 2218, 759, 54], "min_conf": 95.358818}, {"text": "(John xvi. 27, ete.) Again, φιλέω", "box": [410, 2272, 757, 54], "min_conf": 36.534676}, {"text": "is used of Jesus’ love for Lazarus,", "box": [408, 2324, 757, 48], "min_conf": 95.819107}, {"text": "(John xi. 8, 36); but in verse 5", "box": [406, 2375, 761, 102], "min_conf": 89.917007}, {"text": "the word is ἀγαπάω, because there", "box": [406, 2431, 760, 54], "min_conf": 92.475868}, {"text": "the sisters are included, and there-", "box": [404, 2482, 761, 51], "min_conf": 74.933052}, {"text": "fore this word was more correct.", "box": [409, 2537, 756, 43], "min_conf": 95.757492}, {"text": "Again, we are commanded to love", "box": [408, 2590, 760, 54], "min_conf": 85.1931}, {"text": "our enemies, etc., but here ἀγαπάω", "box": [407, 2643, 761, 54], "min_conf": 90.136749}, {"text": "is used, never φιλέω ; love cannot", "box": [407, 2693, 761, 57], "min_conf": 86.221382}, {"text": "be required in this case, though", "box": [407, 2749, 762, 54], "min_conf": 95.310432}, {"text": "kindness and compassion are.", "box": [407, 2803, 760, 53], "min_conf": 93.83519}, {"text": "Again, in John xxi. 15-17, in", "box": [408, 2855, 761, 55], "min_conf": 92.557739}, {"text": "the first question Jesus uses aya-", "box": [407, 2909, 761, 54], "min_conf": 88.680412}, {"text": "πάω, but Peter uses the word", "box": [407, 2961, 763, 49], "min_conf": 93.242966}, {"text": "φιλέω in his reply; this is repeated,", "box": [410, 3015, 759, 55], "min_conf": 61.799248}, {"text": "and then Jesus uses Peter's word", "box": [410, 3069, 760, 42], "min_conf": 20.896332}, {"text": "in the third question. Once more,", "box": [408, 3122, 763, 53], "min_conf": 94.532043}, {"text": "to love (φιλέω) life, from an ex-", "box": [408, 3174, 763, 52], "min_conf": 80.52137}, {"text": "cessive desire to preserve it, and", "box": [412, 3228, 760, 54], "min_conf": 95.883408}, {"text": "80 to lose sight of the real object", "box": [412, 3281, 761, 54], "min_conf": 92.091217}, {"text": "of living, is reproved by our", "box": [412, 3335, 761, 55], "min_conf": 92.237526}, {"text": "Lord, (John xii. 25.) Whereas", "box": [411, 3345, 762, 99], "min_conf": 91.450699}], [{"text": "to love (ἀγαπάω) life, is to consult |", "box": [1330, 419, 807, 100], "min_conf": 36.663498}, {"text": "its real interest. Other examples", "box": [1331, 516, 767, 55], "min_conf": 94.728676}, {"text": "may be traced out with much", "box": [1331, 570, 766, 55], "min_conf": 95.151039}, {"text": "profit, e.g. Mark x. 21.]", "box": [1331, 624, 538, 55], "min_conf": 89.907349}, {"text": "3. θέλω, to will, desire, wish, implying", "box": [1225, 705, 873, 54], "min_conf": 91.802673}, {"text": "active volition and purpose.", "box": [1333, 760, 603, 53], "min_conf":